/p><p>AI巨頭呼籲放慢開發！費半暴跌5.9%　輝達重挫台積ADR受累</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T05:16:15.295846+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2803,"images":28,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}